        "tab_content_683zbz": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>What devices are compatible with this RORRY PalmGo portable charger?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>This PalmGo portable charger for Apple devices is compatible with iPhone 17/16/15 series, iPad Pro and iPad Air, and Apple Watch Ultra 3/Ultra 2/Series 11/10/9/8/7/6/5/4/SE. It features a built-in USB-C connector and a dedicated Apple Watch charger for convenient charging.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_fjWWzA": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>How long to fully recharge the mini power bank?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>The recharge time depends on the charger's power and the ambient temperature. Using a 18W or higher charger at 77°F (25°C), it typically takes about 3.2 hours to fully recharge the power bank.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_Wrb3qd": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Can I use this small portable charger with my phone case on?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes, it is fully compatible as long as your phone case is not thicker than 4mm.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_KQRxtY": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>How can I check the remaining battery level?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>It features a clear digital LED display that shows the exact remaining battery percentage in 1% increments, so you'll always know how much power is left at a glance. </p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_ALMUYQ": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Does this portable charger support fast charging?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes. The 22.5W fast charging output can charge iPhone 17 up to 50% in around 30 minutes, helping you quickly power up when you're on the move.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_NVT3iN": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Is this portable charger easy to carry when traveling?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes. This mini portable charger measures 3.3 × 2.1 × 1.3 inches and weighs only 0.4 lbs, making it compact enough to fit in a pocket, purse, or backpack. It's perfect for travel, commuting, and outdoor activities.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        }
      },
